{"3334980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PixelPop 2087", "steam_appid": 3334980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4796570], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PIXELPOP 2087</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PixelPop 2087 is a game where you must explore ever-changing dungeons, the <strong>map changes with every run</strong>. <strong>Collect the keys</strong> hidden in each room and push forward to the next floor by defeating the Boss guarding the elevator key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standing in your way will be enemies inspired by 1980s pop culture. Some are more dangerous than others, but together they can become a deadly threat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You decide</strong> how to survive: <strong>destroy everything</strong> in your path <strong>or avoid combat</strong> whenever possible by using cover and your special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D action game with rogue-lite elements where you can <strong>choose between two starting characters</strong> and two completely different combat styles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elly</strong> fights with <strong>melee weapons</strong>, excels at fast-paced close combat, and uses an evasive dash ability to survive dangerous encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Johnny</strong>, a lover of <strong>firearms</strong>, prefers distance and heavy firepower! Use his energy shield to block incoming attacks and control the battlefield.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARENA MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to Story Mode, PixelPop 2087 features an Arena Mode where <strong>you must survive endless waves of enemies</strong>. Here, you can freely <strong>combine both melee weapons and firearms</strong> to stay alive for as long as possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where magic and technology are deeply intertwined, and where <strong>the spirit of the ‘80s</strong> is more alive than ever, you are called to become the hero of 2087!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark neighborhood wizard has kidnapped your partner in order to perform a ritual capable of draining all color from the world itself. To save them, you must venture into his fortress, protected by room-shifting magic, dangerous minions, and powerful bosses determined to stop your advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>PixelPop 2087</strong>!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PIXELPOP 2087</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PixelPop 2087 is a game where you must explore ever-changing dungeons, the <strong>map changes with every run</strong>. <strong>Collect the keys</strong> hidden in each room and push forward to the next floor by defeating the Boss guarding the elevator key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standing in your way will be enemies inspired by 1980s pop culture. Some are more dangerous than others, but together they can become a deadly threat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You decide</strong> how to survive: <strong>destroy everything</strong> in your path <strong>or avoid combat</strong> whenever possible by using cover and your special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D action game with rogue-lite elements where you can <strong>choose between two starting characters</strong> and two completely different combat styles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elly</strong> fights with <strong>melee weapons</strong>, excels at fast-paced close combat, and uses an evasive dash ability to survive dangerous encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Johnny</strong>, a lover of <strong>firearms</strong>, prefers distance and heavy firepower! Use his energy shield to block incoming attacks and control the battlefield.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARENA MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to Story Mode, PixelPop 2087 features an Arena Mode where <strong>you must survive endless waves of enemies</strong>. Here, you can freely <strong>combine both melee weapons and firearms</strong> to stay alive for as long as possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where magic and technology are deeply intertwined, and where <strong>the spirit of the ‘80s</strong> is more alive than ever, you are called to become the hero of 2087!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark neighborhood wizard has kidnapped your partner in order to perform a ritual capable of draining all color from the world itself. To save them, you must venture into his fortress, protected by room-shifting magic, dangerous minions, and powerful bosses determined to stop your advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>PixelPop 2087</strong>!</p>", "short_description": "Enter the rooms, grab the keys, proceed and... try to stay alive! Choose your style: melee or fireguns? Fight your way through, get the keys and unlock new rooms!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334980/d5bcf24cd1be092c87391ccb0a6f14abcfe511c2/header.jpg?t=1786890859", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334980/228f6b8c540317429eebaf92ecc7cd293301c082/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786890859", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334980/228f6b8c540317429eebaf92ecc7cd293301c082/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786890859", "website": "https://www.stylerfunkgames.com/games/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel